# Everything in this directory is binary and must be stored byte for byte.
#
# The repository root sets `* text eol=lf`, which is right for source and
# fatal here: committing Patch-A.MPQ under that rule rewrote bytes inside the
# archive that happened to look like line endings, and the file that came back
# out was not the file that went in. It was pushed that way once.
#
# The DBC files survived only because they contained no such sequences, which
# is luck rather than safety.
* binary
